    "html": "<div class=\"cs cs-pages\"><figure class=\"cs-page\"><img src=\"/ft/isr/slides/102.webp\" alt=\"CONSULTATION SCHEDULING Once intake is complete, you should be able to determine if the lead is eligible for consultation, endorse or schedule a consultation. ELIGIBLE LEADS PROVIDE AVAILABLE TIME SLOTS CONSULTATION FEE Always refer to firm’s/attorney’s calendar to avoid double booking. Let callers know of the consultation fee in advance, unrecognized charges may cause dissatisfaction.\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div>"
